    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever noticed how tomato plant leaves look a bit like cannabis leaves?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have. After losing my job and being strapped for cash, the thought crossed my mind more than once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, here we are: starting as a broke store clerk, struggling to make ends meet, dabbling in a few side hustles like growing plants, turning those plants into produce, trading seeds. Maybe someday, we\u2019ll venture into some illicit produce \u2014 if we figure out how to pull it off? Hydroponics, farmland, or hiding plants in the back garden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where do you sell? How you sell? Is it dangerous? All great questions, but I can\u2019t give you those answers. Maybe you'll figure them out before I do?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate strategically\u00a0 Expand your little side hustle into something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/5c4227f0dc8c1e086b286eeaa5315b88.poster.avif?t=1747955519\" width=772 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/5c4227f0dc8c1e086b286eeaa5315b88.webm?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/5c4227f0dc8c1e086b286eeaa5315b88.mp4?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance resources, grow more plants to sell:<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/67e223f9ec6f0b911c183d1f5cf3b2e3.poster.avif?t=1747955519\" width=102 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/67e223f9ec6f0b911c183d1f5cf3b2e3.webm?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/67e223f9ec6f0b911c183d1f5cf3b2e3.mp4?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/73a6240d23343a9f9937a6dc7f09bbd8.poster.avif?t=1747955519\" width=164 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/73a6240d23343a9f9937a6dc7f09bbd8.webm?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/73a6240d23343a9f9937a6dc7f09bbd8.mp4?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy low, Sell high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Plays:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a cosy clicker game, so you can actively engage to progress quickly, or let it run in the background. As your hustle builds, you might be able to make enough to survive, maybe even turn it into your full-time career. Whether you\u2019re tracking every trade fluctuation or chilling with a cosy play style, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/f43602913ba8dd9e9c1d07d8b8fc0768.poster.avif?t=1747955519\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/f43602913ba8dd9e9c1d07d8b8fc0768.webm?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/f43602913ba8dd9e9c1d07d8b8fc0768.mp4?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Now go grow your empire into something amazing, maybe we will meet, or even compete?</p>",
