rc=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365890/extras/f43602913ba8dd9e9c1d07d8b8fc0768.mp4?t=1747955519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Now go grow your empire into something amazing, maybe we will meet, or even compete?</p>",
